      "statement": "The recommended cutover sequence pre-creates the app and root users with `createUser` against the still-unauthenticated `mongod` before merging the auth-enabled compose — users persist on the data volume, so the redeploy reconnects immediately with no unhealthy window; the localhost-exception cutover after auth is already on is the documented fallback, not the recommended path.",
