    {
      "id": "claim_4752024901454156b81b891cb795ec83",
      "statement": "The movie store's keyfile is materialized inside the container from the `MONGO_MC_KEYFILE` environment variable at mode 0400 and mongod is `exec`'d in the same user context that wrote it, so ownership matches by construction; the entrypoint removes any prior keyfile before rewriting it so a plain container restart over a leftover 0400 file does not crash-loop.",
